id: pm-csv-repeated-targets-timeout
title: Investigate repeated-target import model exceeding its fixed test deadline
description: "Complete quick npm test on the caller-pin branch ran 486 tests: 485 passed and the unchanged repeated-target model was cancelled at 180008 ms by its hardcoded 180000 ms test deadline. No assertion failure or skipped test was reported. Investigate fixture cost and shared-load sensitivity while retaining admitted, atomic, streaming and ordinary import/reference-state assertions; do not treat a cancelled case as passing or weaken the existing oracle."
